# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in every working tree,
# on every platform. Without this, contributors on Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# get CRLF working trees, which breaks LF-sensitive tests (markdown-embedded
# code comparisons) and the Biome `format:check` gate locally even though the
# committed blobs are LF. Git auto-detects binary files and leaves them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit for common binary types so they are never EOL-processed.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
